confidence: 85
severity: medium
resolution: "Full-item JSON updates now compare persisted comments, notes, and learnings under the item lock and return a stable actionable refusal for edits or removals; new entries still append."
expected_result: Edited existing notes cannot silently succeed or change item state.
actual_result: "Disposable structured-mutation regression rejects edited note with unchanged verified history; linked test, full suite, exact coverage, and static quality pass."
